*.hprof

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# v1.2.1 SIGNING-PERMANENCE FIX: the release keystore is now COMMITTED to the
# repo ON PURPOSE. Every previous signing key was lost to sandbox wipes (each
# wipe forced a new key → signature mismatch → "App not installed" for users).
# A stable, repo-persisted key means every future release installs as an
# update with no uninstall. Documented in README → "Release signing".
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
!keystore.properties
!release.keystore
